Hi Rares,
  can you provide a reproducible example? Otherwise we can't tell what you are trying to do. Here is a geom_tile plot with 261 discrete values for fill in the legend:

library(ggplot2)
mydf <- data.frame(x = 1, y = factor(1:261))
ggplot(mydf, aes(x, y)) + geom_tile(aes(fill = y))

#R 3.1.1; ggplot2_1.0.0
-Allan

